# TBCGuide - Shadowmoon Valley (68-70), Horde
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide H_Shadowmoon
@name Shadowmoon Valley (Shadowmoon Village)
@faction Horde
@levels 68-70
@zone Shadowmoon Valley
@chapter Outland
@desc Shadowmoon Village: the Legion Hold chain, the Deathforge, the Hand of Gul'dan approach and the Illidari quests. Ends at 70.

fp Shadowmoon Village
bind Shadowmoon Village [area=3744]
accept A Grunt's Work... | Overlord Or'barokh.
accept A Haunted History | Chief Apothecary Hildagard.
accept What Strange Creatures... | Researcher Tiorus.
accept The Sketh'lon Wreckage | Sergeant Kargrul.
complete The Sketh'lon Wreckage | Sketh'lon Commander's Journal - Page 1 drops from Dark Conclave Hawkeye, Dark Conclave Ravenguard and Dark Conclave Shadowmancer. Sketh'lon Commander's Journal 
complete A Grunt's Work...
turnin The Sketh'lon Wreckage
accept Find the Deserter
accept Besieged! | Blood Guard Gulmok.
complete Besieged!
turnin Besieged!
accept To Legion Hold
complete A Haunted History | Ever-burning Ash: loot Ever-burning Ash.
complete What Strange Creatures... | Felfire Spleen drops from Felfire Diemetradon.
complete To Legion Hold | Click Legion Communication Device.
turnin To Legion Hold
accept Setting Up the Bomb
complete Setting Up the Bomb | Fel Reaver Power Core: loot Fel Reaver Power Core. Fel Reaver Armor Plate: loot Fel Reaver Armor Plating.
turnin Setting Up the Bomb
accept Blast the Infernals!
complete Blast the Infernals!
turnin Blast the Infernals!
accept The Deathforge
complete The Deathforge
turnin The Deathforge
accept Minions of the Shadow Council
complete Minions of the Shadow Council
turnin Minions of the Shadow Council
accept The Fate of Kagrosh
accept The Summoning Chamber
complete The Fate of Kagrosh
complete The Summoning Chamber | Elemental Displacer drops from Deathforge Smith and Deathforge Tinkerer.
turnin The Fate of Kagrosh
turnin The Summoning Chamber
accept Bring Down the Warbringer!
complete Bring Down the Warbringer! | Razuun's Orders drops from Warbringer Razuun.
turnin Bring Down the Warbringer!
accept Gaining Access
turnin Gaining Access
accept Invasion Point: Cataclysm
turnin What Strange Creatures...
accept Frankly, It Makes No Sense...
turnin A Grunt's Work...
complete Invasion Point: Cataclysm
turnin Invasion Point: Cataclysm
turnin A Haunted History
accept Spectrecles
complete Spectrecles
complete Frankly, It Makes No Sense...
complete Find the Deserter
turnin Spectrecles
turnin Frankly, It Makes No Sense...
turnin Find the Deserter
level 70
note Congratulations - level 70. Open /tbcg talents to switch to a level-70 build.
